===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{recons|gabulą||tribute|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{recons|ghab(h)-|lang=ine-pro}}, {{recons|gheb(h)-||to take, give, transfer|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with {{etyl|non|-}} {{term|gǫfga||to worship, offer|lang=non|sc=Latinx}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐌲𐌰𐌱𐌴𐌹||tr=gabei|riches|lang=got}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|habeo|habeō|to own, possess, have|lang=la}}. More at {{l|en|give}}.

